{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>עֹשֶׂה מִשְׁפָּט.</b> Even though He is exalted, He does justice for the orphan and the widow, who have no helper — as in the sense of אֲבִי יְתוֹמִים. Likewise the stranger, and He will sustain him, by his leaning upon Him. And since HaShem loves the stranger, you are obligated to love him."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:23:01.019246185Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}